&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One day, Kou meets a demon king&amp;hellip; which is a fatal encounter for him. Who can expect a demon king comes to your room? &amp;ldquo;I&amp;rsquo;m Cruel. You don&amp;rsquo;t need to know who I am. You&amp;rsquo;ll die soon.&amp;rdquo; Kou can&amp;rsquo;t understand what&amp;rsquo;s going on&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cruel&amp;rsquo;s magic power devides into two and one goes to her and the other enters Kou&amp;rsquo;s body. &amp;ldquo;You&amp;rsquo;re now my follower!&amp;rdquo; On the next day, Cruel suddenly transfers to his class and his new life begins&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Akumu ~Aoi Kajitsu no Sanka~</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/3117/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Apr 1996 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/3117/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
